<strong>Photo Result</strong>: SCP-978 is visible on the desk in front of SCP-890. SCP-890 is rolling its eyes and pointing to the door to its cell.<br />
<strong>Note:</strong> <em>When shown the photograph, SCP-890 stated that although it would never actually &quot;be that rude to a patient&quot;, it has &quot;no time for hypochondriacs&quot;.</em></p>
<p><strong>Subject:</strong> <a href="/scp-905">SCP-905</a><br />
<strong>Photographed Activity:</strong> Standing in its containment chamber.<br />
